{"timestamp": 1779402032.4629529, "event_type": "player_moved", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "from": "security", "to": "weapons"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402036.6616771, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779402036.662431, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402041.671977, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Frank\u2019s body in Electrical and reported immediately. My route was Navigation -> Security -> Electrical. I saw Bob in Security around ticks 7-9, and I specifically saw Bob enter Security from Electrical at tick 7. I don\u2019t know if that means Bob did it, but that\u2019s the only person I saw near Electrical before finding Frank dead."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402064.309249, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started Medbay, went through Electrical, then into Security. I saw Charlie in Security around ticks 7-8, and yes, I came from Electrical into Security at tick 7. I did **not** see Frank\u2019s body when I passed through Electrical, and I didn\u2019t see Frank at all.\n\nImportant detail: I saw Charlie leave Security toward Electrical at tick 9, then he reported. So from my perspective, if the body was in Electrical, either the kill happened after I left, or someone else came through after me. I\u2019m not hard accusing Charlie for reporting, but I want that timing noted."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402081.07146, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was Cafeteria -> Medbay -> Electrical -> Security. I saw Frank alive in Electrical at ticks 7, 8, and 9. I also saw Diana enter Electrical from Medbay at tick 8, and she was in Electrical with Frank at ticks 8 and 9.\n\nThat makes Bob\u2019s timing make sense to me: if he passed through Electrical earlier and didn\u2019t see a body, Frank was definitely still alive after that because I saw him. The main person I can place with Frank right before the report is Diana. Charlie reporting from Electrical after leaving Security could be legit, but Diana really needs to explain what happened in Electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402096.462944, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was on the left side the whole round: upper engine, then oxygen, then back toward upper engine. I only saw Diana early \u2014 she came into upper engine from oxygen at tick 1 and was still there tick 2. I didn\u2019t see Frank at all and I wasn\u2019t near Electrical.\n\nThat early sighting doesn\u2019t clear Diana because there was plenty of time for her to get down through Medbay into Electrical by tick 8. Alice saying Frank was alive in Electrical ticks 7-9 and Diana was there with him ticks 8-9 is the strongest info so far. Bob\u2019s story sounds more believable if Frank was alive after Bob left Electrical.\n\nI want to hear Diana\u2019s explanation, but right now Diana is definitely the main suspect to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402145.960608, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "\"I agree with Eve's early sighting\u2014I was on the left side doing my tasks. My full route was Oxygen -> Upper Engine -> Lower Engine -> Storage -> Medbay, and I only stepped into Electrical at tick 9. \n\nAlice is twisting the timeline to save herself because she knows I saw her. When I walked into Electrical at tick 9, Alice and Frank were both there, and Alice immediately bolted toward Security. I didn't see a body yet, so I assumed Frank was just working on a task. But by her own admission, Alice was in Electrical with Frank for ticks 7, 8, and 9. \n\nIf Frank died, Alice had all the time in the world to do it before I even got there, or she killed him right as she was leaving to Security. The only other possibility is Charlie killing him when he walked in from Security right after Alice left. Alice is hard accusing me because she was alone with Frank the longest and needs a scapegoat. She\u2019s trying to shift the blame to the person who walked in on her. I\u2019m voting Alice.\""}}
{"timestamp": 1779402182.992, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can add/confirm: I was in Security ticks 7-9 with Bob there, then I left Security toward Electrical and found Frank dead immediately in Electrical.\n\nI did **not** see Alice enter Security while I was there. Bob was the only one I saw in Security. So Diana saying Alice \u201cbolted toward Security\u201d at tick 9 doesn\u2019t line up with what I personally saw, unless Alice was still in the hallway after I left.\n\nBob is less suspicious to me now because Alice says Frank was alive after Bob had already left Electrical. The main conflict is Alice vs Diana. Alice gave a specific claim that Diana was with Frank in Electrical ticks 8-9; Diana is denying that and pushing Alice. Based on my info, I\u2019m leaning Diana right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402204.5847712, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my confirmed info: I came Medbay -> Electrical -> Security, entered Security at tick 7, and Charlie was there with me ticks 7-8. I saw Charlie leave Security toward Electrical at tick 9, and then the report happened.\n\nAlice saying Frank was alive after I passed through Electrical clears me a bit, because I didn\u2019t see any body when I went through. The key conflict is Alice vs Diana. Charlie not seeing Alice in Security makes Diana\u2019s \u201cAlice bolted into Security\u201d claim weaker to me, unless Alice was in hallway and not actually in the room.\n\nGiven Alice placed Diana with Frank in Electrical ticks 8-9, and Diana is denying that while redirecting onto Alice, I\u2019m leaning Diana as the better vote right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402225.2838159, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to be really clear because Diana is trying to flip this onto me.\n\nMy route was Cafeteria -> Medbay -> Electrical -> toward Security. In Electrical, I saw Frank alive at ticks 7, 8, and 9. I saw Diana enter Electrical from Medbay at tick 8, and she was still there with Frank at tick 9.\n\nDiana saying she \u201conly stepped in at tick 9\u201d is not what I saw. I saw her enter at tick 8. Also, Charlie saying he didn\u2019t see me in Security makes sense \u2014 I was heading that way, but the report happened basically immediately, so I likely never actually made it into the room before the meeting got called.\n\nBob\u2019s story lines up because Frank was alive after Bob left Electrical. Charlie\u2019s report also lines up with him leaving Security and finding the body. The biggest contradiction is Diana denying being in Electrical with Frank when I saw her there. I think Diana is the vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402236.2387142, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can only hard-confirm Diana was left side early: I saw her enter Upper Engine from Oxygen at tick 1 and still there tick 2. After that I didn\u2019t see her, so she absolutely had time to go Lower Engine -> Storage/Medbay -> Electrical by tick 8 or 9.\n\nThe big thing for me is the contradiction: Alice says Diana was in Electrical with Frank at ticks 8-9, and Diana says she only arrived tick 9 and that Alice ran to Security. But Charlie says he was in Security and didn\u2019t see Alice come in, which makes Diana\u2019s version weaker. Bob and Charlie also line up with each other, and Frank being alive after Bob passed through makes Bob unlikely.\n\nSo from what we have, Diana is the best vote for me."}}
